[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0010","text":"快看快看！\n那边在拍摄，是婚纱照吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0020","text":"真的呢……！好美\n不过……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0030","text":"风这么大，挺辛苦的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0040","text":"懂、懂你懂你……我以前拍摄时也遇到大风\n头发和衣服都被吹乱了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0050","text":"我还遇到过帽子被吹飞了呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0060","text":"而且还会觉得对不起在旁边看着的人和工作人员呢……新郎新娘的心情真让人心疼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0070","text":"这种时候……\n该怎么做……才好呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0080","text":"那只能……\n祈祷风停下来了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0085","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_03_0100","text":"在干什么呢……？"}]
